    the Website works.</p>

  <h2 class="h5 mt-4">How long we keep information</h2>
  <p>We keep personal information only for as long as needed for the purposes described above, unless a longer
    period is required by law or reasonably needed for security, disputes, or business records.</p>

  <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Your rights</h2>
  <p>Subject to applicable law, you may request access to, or correction of, personal information we hold about
    you. You may also complain to us if you believe we have handled your information improperly.</p>
  <p>If you are not satisfied with our response, you may contact the Office of the Australian Information
    Commissioner (OAIC) at <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">oaic.gov.au</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>The Website may link to third-party sites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>

  <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Changes</h2>
